  "commentary": {
    "market_commentary": "The SSY Pacific Capesize Index reached 11,937 points on 23 August, up 1,852 week-on-week. Meanwhile, the Pacific round-voyage rate climbed $8,000/day to $53,000/day. The W.Australia-China iron ore spot voyage rate also rose, up $1.30/t to reach its highest level in over a decade at $16.00/t.",
    "index_notes": "The Pacific Capesize Index started at 5,000 points on 27 December 1995 and has since been subject to periodic updating to reflect changing trade patterns. The latest update was on 17 July 2015.",
